                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg860">p. 860</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d507-f3" n="41" xml:id="d507-f3-content">
                <p>Baruch concluded a memorandum to Senator Austin, also dated November 2, as
                    follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I warned the State Department on June 23, that the Soviets would be
                            likely to make this latest move, and I wanted to make it first.</p>
                        <p>There must be closer coordination of the work in the United Nations. The
                            present disjointed method cannot bring results, even with all the
                            ability and good will of our delegations.” (USUN Files)</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
